    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Large Object</em></p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 15 <strong>Hit Points:</strong> 100</p><p><em><strong>Ram (Requires Position).</strong></em> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +8, reach 5 ft. <em>Hit:</em> 16 (3d10) Bludgeoning damage.</p><p>A Ram consists of a movable gallery equipped with a heavy log suspended from two roof beams by chains. The log is shod in iron and used to batter through doors and barricades. Positioning a Ram requires three Utilize actions. Then a crew member can use the Ram action.</p><p>The gallery roof gives the operators &amp;Reference[Total Cover] against attacks and other effects from above.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-BrA9tvhEbS4ebsJn\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This item has 3 limited uses for tracking positioning.</p><p>The <strong>Position</strong> activity grants one use so after three uses you can use the <strong>Ram</strong> activity.</p></section>",
